  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0f1b918fc5de4f448a14402d08e1f332, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryContent
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryContent
  introductionText:
  - 'Stable port to Qurotema. Vision coming in for RO.

    Visuals on our end are...
    good enough.'
  - 'Stable comms. Gates forcing one-way channel.

    Expected.'
  - All set. We'll be observing Qurotema alongside you, Operator.
  - Initiating vessel control.
  - And, Di? Make Sino proud.
  monolithText:
  - 'Confirming i-tema characters on visual feed.

    Loading local translations
    to compare.'
  - 'Huh, this is our only translated entry. Seems unlikely.

    "The night will
    flow when black time''s sand knows foreign touch."'
  - 'The gates share two of those words, "Quro" and "Tema". Black time.

    No gates
    visible though. Odd.'
  - 'Anyways, this isn''t new information.

    Find more monoliths, we''ll fill
    the database for linguistic analysis.'
  instrumentText:
  - 'Som.thing happen.d!

    Faint s.gnal n.ar your vessel''s current pos.tion.'
  - 'An.ther click.

    L.st v.sual fe.d, st.ll getting a.l oth.r r.adings. Just
    ke.p up the research.'
  - 'Th.s .sn''t r..ht.

    Con.ection is bec.m.ng too unrel..ble. I''m begin..ng
    a pull.'
  endText:
  - Lo.ing co..ection fas.! RO, wh.t's ..ing on?
  - RO? Di? B.dy ......  ..resp.n.ive. ...... ret.r. pro.ocol ...... .....cit.te.
  - No p.ng on Qur..ema? ...... ves.el ...... vo.d.
  - ...... ...... ......
  uniqueText:
  - 'Monolith visual confirmed. Strange, there''s no writing on it.

    Is it inactive?'
  - 'Confirming new reading. Incredible! There''s nothing like this in Sino''s notes.

    Keep
    experimenting, maybe we can learn something.'
  - Press escape again to disconnect.
